text: >-
  1984 @TheOfficial1984 • 4h

  X moderation teams= CHEQ=AU10TIX=ISRAELI INTELLIGENCE

  O ...

  They can and have shut down spaces im real time.

  4. Post-Analysis Actions and Reporting:

  • Flagged content is routed to X's moderation

  teams or ADL's Center for Technology & Society

  (CTS) for review. Aggregated data feeds into ADL's

  annual reports, like the 2024 "Threads of Hate"

  analysis, which examined reinstated accounts'

  Spaces activity.

  • Real-time monitoring uses edge computing to

  process data with minimal latency (<5 seconds),

  enabling proactive interventions during live

  sessions.

  This process is powered by collaborations with academic

  labs (e.g., UC Berkeley's D-Lab, where early OHI versions

  were developed) and tech firms, with ADL claiming it

  processes millions of data points weekly across platforms.

  0 1

  17 4

  ~ 14

  ill 164

  • I

  1984 @TheOfficial1984 • 4h

  O ...

  The Rasch item response theory (IRT) used to target and group speech

  assigning a weight and label to score the "quality" of your account, in real

  time, continuously.

  Berkley DLab

  Outcome phenomena are typically measured

  at the binary level: a comment is toxic or not

  an MRI scan shows cancer or is clear, a patient

  is diagnosed as having a disease or not. But

  underlying that dichotomization there is often

  a continuous spectrum or latent variable.

  Physical quantities such as temperature and

  weight can be measured as interval variables

  where magnitudes are meaningful. How can

  we acmeve hasame ineva measuremen

  for arbitrary outcomes - creating continuous

  scales with magnitudes?

  We propose a general method for measuring

  complex phenomena as continuous, interval

  variables by integrating deep learning with

  the Constructing Meosures approach to faceted

  Rasch item response theory (IRT). We

  decompose the target construct into multiple

  constituent components that are labeled as

  ordinal survey items, and are transformed via

  an IRT nonlinear activation into a high-quality

  continuous measure. We estimate the survey

  interpretation bias of the human labelers and

  eliminate its influence on the final construct

  when creating a training dataset, which

  removes labeling blas and supersedes tre use

  of inter-rater reliability as a quality diagnostic.

  0 1

  17 4

  © 13

  ilal 155

  1984 @TheOfficial1984. 4h

  Basically, this is how you shift perception using a labeling bias and
  filtering

  out accounts that dont fit the narrative.

  We propose a general method for measuring

  complex phenomena as continuous, interval

  variables by integrating deep learning with

  the Constructing Measures approach to faceted

  Rasch item response theory (IRT). We

  decompose the target construct into multiple

  constituent components that are labeled as

  ordinal survey items, and are transformed via

  an IRT nonlinear activation into a high-quality

  continuous measure. We estimate the survey

  interpretation bias of the human labelers and

  eliminate its influence on the final construct

  when creating a training dataset, which

  removes labeling bias and supersedes the use

  of inter-rater reliability as a quality diagnostic.

  We further estimate the response quality of

  each individual labeler using faceted IRT,

  allowing responses from low-quality labelers

  to be removed.

  0 1

  t74

  © 21

  ila 580

  • 1

  → 1984 @TheOfficial1984 • 4h

  C ...

  Once the ADL's OHI flags the speech and labels the account, it sends it to

  CHEQ (israeli intelligence) and AU10TIX (israeli intelligence) who then

  remove the content and add threats to the digital kill chain (Lavender X)

  Au10tix closes the loop: OHI detects, Cheq validates, Au10tix

  identifies-turning algorithmic flags into real-world

  traceability.

  t) 15

  • 65

  ill 1.9K

  • 1

  1984 @TheOfficial1984. 4h

  X is a cesspool.

  O ...

  • CHEQ has the deepest IDF integration, reflecting

  Israel's "Startup Nation" model where ~10% of tech

  firms trace to Unit 8200 alumni.

  • Zignal Labs and Clock Tower X represent

  operational/government ties rather than veteran-led

  structures.

  • The others (Graphika, SIO) engage Israel topically but

  aren't affiliated.

  • These connections raise questions about neutrality in

  psyop detection—e.g., potential biases in monitoring

  pro-Palestinian content-but X's contracts prioritize

  bot/fraud prevention.

  • 5

  t7 18

  • 63

  ila 1.7K

  1

  The Curious Observer @ShdwWzrdmnygn • 2h

  Commentary account

  Speedrun any% to see who can get the lowest possible credit score.

  C ...

  World record, anyone?

